{
  "slug": "aiwff",
  "name": "Aiwff",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AIWFF Claude Plugin  Fleet-aware worker dispatch helpers for Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `new-task` (Create a new AIWFF task entry (does not spawn a worker)), `start-worker` (Spawn an AIWFF worker for an existing task id), `stop-all` (Stop every active AIWFF worker), `stop-worker` (Stop a single AIWFF worker by id), `task` (Show details of a single AIWFF task by id), `tasks` (List AIWFF tasks), `worker-status` (Show recent progress / status snapshot for a single AIWFF worker by id), `workers` (List active AIWFF workers and whether they are alive)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install aiwff@claude-community` from `zaxardery8011-design/aiwff-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
